OL,3,GNEWSABuilder of collapsed bridge says
OL,4,Ahe warned council
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe builder of a landmark bridge that
OL,7,Fhas collapsed says he warned the
OL,8,Fcouncil and offered to secure it after
OL,9,Fit first malfunctioned.
OL,11,FPero's Bridge in Bristol was closed in
OL,12,FAugust when a lifting mechanism failed.
OL,13,FOn Saturday, it collapsed, leaving part
OL,14,Fof it submerged in water.
OL,16,FBristol City Council said there was "no
OL,17,Fconfirmed impact to the maintenance and
OL,18,Frefurbishment programme" which would
OL,19,Fsee it reopen in Spring 2027.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
