OL,3,GNEWSABuilder of collapsed bridge says
OL,4,Ahe warned council
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavid Abels who built the structure,
OL,7,Fsaid he had sent an email to the
OL,8,Fcouncil to say he would be able to
OL,9,Fassist in the repair of the bridge,
OL,10,Fwarning it could slip further if
OL,11,Fnothing was done. The council confirmed
OL,12,Fit received the email and passed it
OL,13,Fonto the engineering team.
